OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy for
OL,6,Fmost of the night, but clear spells,
OL,7,Fcoupled with light winds, developing
OL,8,Fby the early hours of Thursday
OL,9,Fmorning, allowing some fog to form.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FFog slow to clear during the
OL,12,Fmorning. A mix of sunny spells and
OL,13,Fcloudy periods during the afternoon.
OL,14,FWinds remain light for most.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FSettled
OL,17,Fand largely dry in the coming days.
OL,18,FLight winds allow extensive fog to
OL,19,Fform during the mornings, slowly
OL,20,Fburning away to give some sunny
OL,21,Fspells. Near average temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
